@guide A_Shadowmoon
@name Shadowmoon Valley (Wildhammer Stronghold)
@faction Alliance
@levels 68-70
@zone Shadowmoon Valley
@chapter Outland
@desc Wildhammer Stronghold: the Legion Hold chain, the Deathforge, the Netherwing ledge approach and the Hand of Gul'dan. Ends at 70.

fp Wildhammer Stronghold
bind Wildhammer Stronghold
accept Put On Yer Kneepads... | Thane Yoregar.
accept Spleendid! | Gnomus.
accept A Ghost in the Machine | Zorus the Judicator.
accept The Sketh'lon Wreckage | Gryphonrider Kieran.
complete The Sketh'lon Wreckage | Sketh'lon Commander's Journal - Page 1 drops from Dark Conclave Hawkeye, Dark Conclave Ravenguard and Dark Conclave Shadowmancer. Sketh'lon Commander's Journal 
complete Put On Yer Kneepads...
turnin The Sketh'lon Wreckage
accept Find the Deserter
accept Besieged! | Wing Commander Nuainn.
complete Besieged! | Infernal attackers outside the stronghold.
turnin Besieged!
accept To Legion Hold
complete A Ghost in the Machine | Ever-burning Ash: loot Ever-burning Ash.
complete Spleendid! | Felfire Spleen drops from Felfire Diemetradon.
complete To Legion Hold | Legion Hold, west Shadowmoon.
turnin To Legion Hold
accept Setting Up the Bomb
complete Setting Up the Bomb | Fel Reaver Power Core: loot Fel Reaver Power Core. Fel Reaver Armor Plate: loot Fel Reaver Armor Plating.
turnin Setting Up the Bomb
accept Blast the Infernals!
complete Blast the Infernals!
turnin Blast the Infernals!
accept The Deathforge
complete The Deathforge
turnin The Deathforge
accept Minions of the Shadow Council
complete Minions of the Shadow Council
turnin Minions of the Shadow Council
accept The Fate of Flanis
accept The Summoning Chamber
complete The Fate of Flanis
complete The Summoning Chamber | Elemental Displacer drops from Deathforge Smith and Deathforge Tinkerer.
turnin The Fate of Flanis
turnin The Summoning Chamber
accept Bring Down the Warbringer!
complete Bring Down the Warbringer! | Razuun's Orders drops from Warbringer Razuun.
turnin Bring Down the Warbringer!
accept Gaining Access
turnin Gaining Access
accept Invasion Point: Cataclysm
turnin Spleendid!
accept The Second Course...
turnin Put On Yer Kneepads...
turnin A Ghost in the Machine
accept Harbingers of Shadowmoon
complete Harbingers of Shadowmoon
complete The Second Course... | Overdeveloped Felfire Gizzard drops from Greater Felfire Diemetradon.
turnin Harbingers of Shadowmoon
turnin The Second Course...
complete Find the Deserter
turnin Find the Deserter
complete Invasion Point: Cataclysm
turnin Invasion Point: Cataclysm
level 70
note Congratulations - level 70. Open /tbcg talents to switch to a level-70 build, and check the dungeon and heroic attunement quests for your next goals.
